Package: drobo-webui
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: George Stephanis <george@bigorangelab.com>
Depends: lighttpd, lighttpd-mod-openssl, openssl, php-cgi, php-cli, sudo, smartmontools, hdparm, gpiod, iproute2, systemd, udev, util-linux, passwd
Suggests: samba, wsdd2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/georgestephanis/drobo-5n
Description: Web dashboard for a Drobo 5N running Debian
 Optional status page and settings for the drobo-5n kit: bays, disks and SMART,
 capacity, temperatures and fan, network, services, logs, e-mail alerts, bay
 power, device name, HTTPS with a self-signed certificate, fan settings, reboot and shut down,
 and network sharing of bay disks through Samba with per-person access.
 Needs about 25 MB with its dependencies; the base kit works without it.
